3. JAVA AND KOTLIN LIBRARIES
----------------------------

The application links against the Android Jetpack libraries, the Kotlin
standard library and coroutines, Dagger, Retrofit, OkHttp, Coil and Timber.
All of these are distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; its text is
shipped as `licenses/apache-2.0.txt`.

The authoritative, complete dependency list is `buildSrc/src/main/java/deps.kt`
together with the `build.gradle.kts` files of each module.


